      "context": "The four complete castle exchanges identify the upturned ornament as シャチホコ;the independent item title is 鯱の像. The shared title appears in catalog/list,story card and generated acquisition consumers. Its Figurehead category remains separate. Guard and daimyo speech and Jam's boast/letter have their own distinct voices.",
